ProsperoSunshine: the round trip and packet size of a session, for the PS5 capture's keyframe policy

video_ps5.cpp decides which keyframe requests reach the encoder (video/keyframe_policy.hpp). It needs each requesting
session's control round trip (patch 0015 keeps it) to tell a request that the last keyframe already answers from one
sent after it, and the session's packet size to know whether it streams over the internet, where the video pacer
(patch 0026) keeps its bursts small.

